摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Feishu and Lark text and image channel plugin for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1333402798","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"DeepSeek-harness-lark","slug":"sliverp/DeepSeek-harness-lark","topics":["chatbot","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","feishu","lark"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Feishu and Lark text and image channel plugin for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DeepSeek Harness Lark / Feishu plugin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness channel powered by the official `@larksuiteoapi/node-sdk`. It uses the official W"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ebSocket transport, so no public callback server is required, and supports both Feishu and internati"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ransport, so no public callback server is required, and supports both Feishu and international Lark."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- Official WebSocket connection and automatic reconnection\n- Direct and group access policies; group"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"s require a bot mention by default\n- Text, rich-text, image, and ordinary-file input\n- Durable Harne"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ss attachments with model-aware multimodal input\n- Ordinary files are downloaded into `.dsh-lark/inb"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"ox/` under the Agent workspace so filesystem tools can inspect them\n- Model text replies, generated-"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"image upload, and workspace-file delivery\n- Persistent, isolated Harness sessions per chat; `/new` r"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"etains old history and switches to a blank session\n- Agent presets are mounted and recorded for both"},{"id":"p5s7","text":" creation and resume; the default is `standard`\n- Registered Harness slash commands execute directly"},{"id":"p5s8","text":" instead of being sent to the model\n- Same-conversation `/approve <code>` and `/reject <code>` decis"},{"id":"p5s9","text":"ions for one-shot tool approvals\n- `/bot-ping`, `/bot-help`, `/bot-image-test`, `/bot-file-test`, `/"},{"id":"p5s10","text":"bot-status`, `/bot-cancel`\n- App Secret resolution through the Harness credential service\n- Dormant "},{"id":"p5s11","text":"startup when App ID or App Secret is not configured, so installation alone never blocks Harness Web"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Node.js 22.19 or later\n- pnpm 10.33.4\n- DeepSeek Harness 0.1.0-rc.7 or later"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"For a local checkout:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Configure the Lark application"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"1. Create a custom application in the Feishu developer console and enable its bot capability.\n2. Gra"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"nt `im:message.p2p_msg:readonly`, `im:message.group_at_msg:readonly`, `im:message:readonly`, `im:mes"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"sage:send_as_bot`, and `im:resource`. The `im:message:readonly` scope is required by Feishu's messag"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"e-resource download endpoint for user-sent images and files.\n3. Select long-connection event deliver"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"y and subscribe to `im.message.receive_v1`.\n4. Publish an application version and add the bot to the"},{"id":"p13s6","text":" required chats.\n5. Put the App ID in `LARK_APP_ID` and store the App Secret under the Harness crede"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"ntial reference `LARK_APP_SECRET`."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Environment injection is supported for development:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"For durable use, put the App ID in `~/.dsh/.env` and store the App Secret through the Harness creden"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"tial settings surface. Never commit credentials."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Bundle configuration"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"International Lark and restrictive policy example:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Access policies accept `open`, `allowlist`, or `disabled`. Use allowlists and least-privilege Harnes"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"s permissions in production."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Connection and authentication run in the background. Missing or invalid Lark credentials leave this "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"channel offline and are logged without blocking Harness startup."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Inbound images and ordinary files are downloaded through the message-scoped resource endpoint using "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"their matching `message_id` and resource key; this requires `im:message:readonly` (or the broader `i"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"m:message`). The separate `im:resource` scope remains necessary for bot-side image/file upload. File"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"names are reduced to safe leaf names, files are created without overwriting existing paths, and each"},{"id":"p23s5","text":" message gets a private directory below `<cwd>/.dsh-lark/inbox/`. The defaults allow 10 files, 50 Mi"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"B per file, and 100 MiB total per message. The model receives the saved path and must use its normal"},{"id":"p23s7","text":" filesystem tools to read the file; file contents are not executed or silently injected into the pro"},{"id":"p23s8","text":"esystem tools to read the file; file contents are not executed or silently injected into the prompt."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"When the model intentionally returns a regular workspace file, it places an explicit Markdown link t"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"o that file in the final visible answer. The plugin resolves the canonical path, rejects missing fil"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"es, directories, symlink escapes, and every target outside the session `cwd`, then uploads the bound"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"ed bytes with Lark's file API. Only the final assistant message is inspected; intermediate tool outp"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"ut cannot trigger a file send. By default, one reply may send up to 5 non-empty files of at most 30 "},{"id":"p24s6","text":" trigger a file send. By default, one reply may send up to 5 non-empty files of at most 30 MiB each."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"When Harness requests tool approval, the plugin sends a requester-bound six-digit code to the origin"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ating chat. Reply `/approve <code>` to allow that operation once or `/reject <code>` to deny it. Cod"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"es are one-shot, cannot cross chats, bypass ordinary message capacity while the original turn waits,"},{"id":"p25s4","text":" and fail closed on timeout, cancellation, send failure, or shutdown. `approvalTimeoutMs` must remai"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"n below `responseTimeoutMs`."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"`agentPreset` is the explicit fallback for new sessions and persisted records without a preset. The "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"tool-loop fix advances the plugin session namespace from `lark-v1-*` to `lark-v2-*`: existing files "},{"id":"p26s3","text":"are neither deleted nor rewritten, but the plugin no longer appends to potentially DSML-contaminated"},{"id":"p26s4","text":" `lark-v1-*` records. They remain available for inspection in the Web UI."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Verify"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Send `/bot-ping`, `/bot-image-test`, `/bot-file-test`, and `/new`. The bot should return `pong`, a b"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"lue diagnostic image, a downloadable text file, and confirmation that it switched to a blank session"},{"id":"p28s3","text":". Send ordinary text, an image, and a CSV file; ask the bot to inspect the CSV and verify that it us"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"es the downloaded workspace path. Then ask it to create and send a CSV; the final reply should conta"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"in the file attachment. Request an operation that needs approval and reply with the exact `/approve "},{"id":"p28s6","text":"<code>` or `/reject <code>` shown; the same turn should continue or stop without using the Web appro"},{"id":"p28s7","text":" `/reject <code>` shown; the same turn should continue or stop without using the Web approval panel."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Develop"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The repository uses PNPM `10.33.4`. Plugin runtime requires Node.js `>=22.19` and does not require P"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"ository uses PNPM `10.33.4`. Plugin runtime requires Node.js `>=22.19` and does not require PNPM 11."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Protocol and configuration behavior were cross-checked against larksuite/openclaw-lark. Transport an"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"d media operations use the official Lark Node SDK. MIT licensed."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
